0
00:00:07,179 --> 00:00:08,246
♪ ♪ ♪

1
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:10,047
(camera clicking)

2
00:00:10,047 --> 00:00:13,351
Tyra: MODELING FOR A LIVING

3
00:00:13,351 --> 00:00:15,387
CAN BE DAZZLING.

4
00:00:17,456 --> 00:00:19,524
BUT A GIRL'S FIRST STEPS TOWARD
BECOMING A MODEL...

5
00:00:23,628 --> 00:00:24,896
OOPS.

6
00:00:27,099 --> 00:00:28,800
ARE NEVER EASY.

7
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:30,669
BUT YOU HAVE TO PUT YOUR BEST
FOOD FORWARD

8
00:00:30,669 --> 00:00:32,637
TO MAKE IT TO THE TOP.

9
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:37,843
THIS CYCLE
OF "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"

10
00:00:37,843 --> 00:00:39,277
THOUSANDS OF GIRLS TRIED OUT.

11
00:00:39,277 --> 00:00:42,347
MODELING IS MY PASSION,
MY DREAM, MY DESIRE.

12
00:00:42,347 --> 00:00:44,382
I'M AN ONLY CHILD,
I HAVE NO SIBLINGS

13
00:00:44,382 --> 00:00:46,051
SO BASICALLY, IT'S ABOUT ME.

14
00:00:46,051 --> 00:00:47,953
OKAY, LET'S GO.

15
00:00:48,086 --> 00:00:51,757
Tyra: BUT ONLY A SELECT FEW GOT
FLOWN TO L.A. FOR SEMI-FINALS.

16
00:00:52,157 --> 00:00:55,093
AFTER A WEEK OF AUDITIONS...

17
00:00:56,595 --> 00:00:57,863
I AM A NURSE.

18
00:00:57,863 --> 00:00:59,831
SO IF YOU HAVE SOME TYPE OF
WEIRD RASH GOING ON,

19
00:00:59,831 --> 00:01:00,999
I CAN LOOK AT THAT.

20
00:01:00,999 --> 00:01:03,935
CAN YOU SEE THE SHAKING,
THIS IS UNBELIEVABLE.

21
00:01:03,935 --> 00:01:05,937
Tyra: WE PICKED OUR FINAL 14.

22
00:01:05,937 --> 00:01:08,406
- YES.
- OH MY GOD!

23
00:01:08,406 --> 00:01:10,709
(screaming)

24
00:01:10,709 --> 00:01:12,377
Tyra: AFTER 12 WEEKS OF
COMPETITION,

25
00:01:12,377 --> 00:01:14,045
CAMARADERIE
AND CONTROVERSY...

26
00:01:14,045 --> 00:01:16,248
(screaming)

27
00:01:16,248 --> 00:01:19,284
WE'VE GONE FROM 14 GIRLS
DOWN TO OUR FINAL THREE:

28
00:01:19,284 --> 00:01:24,156
KAHLEN, KEENYAH AND NAIMA.

29
00:01:24,156 --> 00:01:26,158
TONIGHT, SEE HOW IT ALL WENT
DOWN,

30
00:01:26,158 --> 00:01:28,493
FROM REBECCA'S COLLAPSE...

31
00:01:28,493 --> 00:01:30,061
(gasping)
OH MY GOD.

32
00:01:30,061 --> 00:01:31,530
TO MICHELLE'S SKIN CONDITION...

33
00:01:31,530 --> 00:01:34,166
Noelle:
IT LOOKS LIKE SHE'S PUTTING OUT
CIGARETTES ON HER FACE.

34
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:35,567
Tyra: TO MY TIFF WITH TIFFANY.

35
00:01:35,567 --> 00:01:39,805
BE QUIET! THAT'S WHAT IS WRONG
WITH YOU, STOP IT!

36
00:01:39,805 --> 00:01:42,374
I HAVE NEVER IN MY LIFE
YELLED AT A GIRL LIKE THIS!

37
00:01:42,374 --> 00:01:45,644
PLUS, NEVER-BEFORE-SEEN MOMENTS
YOU WON'T WANNA MISS.

38
00:01:45,877 --> 00:01:49,080
'CAUSE I'M JUST THE BITCH JUDGE,
GET USED TO IT.

39
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,516
Tyra: SOME GIRLS GET PASSIONATE.

40
00:01:51,516 --> 00:01:54,820
AND ONE GIRL GOES OVER THE EDGE.

41
00:01:57,656 --> 00:01:59,658
