STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM THE SEASON FINALE

1036
00:42:04,288 --> 00:42:06,156
OF "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL".

1037
00:42:08,692 --> 00:42:10,694
TOMORROW ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL".

1038
00:42:10,694 --> 00:42:13,864
KAHLEN, NAIMA AND KEENYAH
HAVE ALMOST MADE IT TO THE TOP.

1039
00:42:13,864 --> 00:42:15,833
