THEY HAVE TO BATTLE IT OUT

1040
00:42:15,833 --> 00:42:17,134
IN A COVER GIRL
COMMERCIAL SHOOT.

1041
00:42:17,134 --> 00:42:18,969
ENERGY, PLEASE!

1042
00:42:18,969 --> 00:42:20,904
Tyra: AND IN
A CAPE TOWN RUNWAY SHOW.

1043
00:42:20,904 --> 00:42:22,973
IT ALL LEADS UP
TO THE FINAL DECISION.

1044
00:42:22,973 --> 00:42:25,509
WHO WILL BE
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"?

1045
